WEBVTT - English subtitles adapted from Blender Institute's official Tears of Steel subtitles (CC BY 3.0)

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.000
...and, action!

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:08.000
Memory overwrite in progress!

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.000
You're a jerk, Thom!

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:15.000
Ohp— Sorry! Sorry.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Look Celia.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:30.000
We have to follow our passions.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:33.000
You have your robotics...

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:38.000
...and I just want to be awesome in space.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:48.800
[Dialogue pauses as the scene continues.]

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:51.000
Okay, they're coming. Two minutes left!

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Speed it up, Thom!

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Vivacissimo!

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Why don't you just admit that you're
freaked out by my robot hand?
